+# WD07 stopped — TinyURL wire activation prerequisite is absent
+
+Assessed on `20d2c22ab20ca2180e9fe51eaa0001da66e66878`, after WD06 stopped and
+restored its activation work. The current studio supplies neither `LineSpec.wire` nor
+`Board.lanes`; the optional WD04 renderer creates `.board-wire` only for `data.wire`.
+
+The proposed work contains the exact WD07 CSS, one new TinyURL E2E case and one sentence in
+`docs/studio.md`. No existing test body/assertion or board TypeScript was changed. The only
+mechanical adjustment was Biome wrapping the new blueprint assertion. React Flow's actual
+`.react-flow__edges` wrapper and `.react-flow__edge` children match the supplied selector;
+no class-name adjustment is needed.
+
+The native browser run on isolated 4301/4311 created its own TinyURL projects by mouse and
+cleaned them up. The unchanged TinyURL canvas test passed. The new WD07 test switched to
+Simple by mouse and failed its necessary wire-count assertion: expected 12, received 0.
+The preserved trace's last full edge markup contains one edge wrapper, twelve legacy edges,
+twelve arrowheads, zero `.board-wire` groups and zero `.board-wire-fill` paths. The screenshot
+was visually inspected: TinyURL renders its ordinary solid/dashed lines.
+
+The hover step, opacity checks and after-blueprint assertion were **not reached**. The
+required TinyURL hover behavior is unperformable with this prerequisite absent; no successful
+hover or before/after blueprint claim is made. Generic optional board CSS cannot establish the
+required studio behavior. Enabling wires would reimplement stopped WD06, outside this unit.
+No WD06 patch was applied and no alternative design or skip was introduced.
+
+`browser-failure.log` preserves the failure (one existing pass / one new failure, 11.6s),
+`browser-dom-evidence.json` the direct DOM counts, and `browser-trace.zip` the exact trace.
+`tinyurl-simple-no-wires.png` and `browser-error-context.md` show the rendered failure state.
+`biome-initial.log` and `biome-corrected.log` preserve the formatting finding and correction.
+
+All proposed source/test/docs and these new evidence files are saved only inside
+`stopped/WD07.patch`, then removed/restored to exact starting bytes and modes. Required full
+checks run on that restored tree; their results and preservation checks are recorded in the
+append-only WD07 stopped handoff. No WD08 or later unit was read or executed.
